    "summary": "The second reference domain package reserved by the architecture roadmap: `packages/rustev-pkg-lodging`, containing a bounded lodging-recommendation definition, canonical documents, synthetic mechanics fixtures, and evaluation material. The package preserves exact eligibility, explicit trust treatment, bounded semantic fan-out, abstention, lineage, offline replay, partial adoption, and backend-swap comparison without claiming semantic quality, external readiness, or authority to book lodging.\n",
